{\rtf1\ansi\deff0\nouicompat{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Calibri;}}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs28\b\ul\qc Bogotá Dreamin' 2025 - Sponsorship Proposal\par\b0\ulnone\fs22\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs22\par\b Event Overview\b0\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par Bogotá Dreamin' is a Salesforce-focused community event designed to bring together professionals, enthusiasts, and organizations interested in learning, sharing, and growing within the Salesforce ecosystem in Colombia.\par\par The event will gather an audience of at least 100 attendees, including beginners, QA professionals, functional consultants, developers, architects, sales teams, and business leaders.\par\par The event will feature multiple sessions, lightning talks, and networking moments centered around Salesforce innovation, business value, ecosystem growth, and digital transformation.\par\par\b Why sponsor Bogotá Dreamin'?\b0\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par Sponsoring Bogotá Dreamin' is an opportunity to connect with a highly relevant audience in the Salesforce ecosystem, while also supporting a community-driven event that promotes knowledge sharing and professional growth in Colombia.\par\par Our sponsorship model is designed to provide visibility and business value to companies that want to strengthen their presence in the Salesforce ecosystem, while also contributing to a high-quality event experience for attendees.\par\par\b Sponsorship Objectives\b0\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par\bullet This event aims to: \par\bullet Create a high-impact space for Salesforce professionals in Colombia.\par\bullet Build connections between industry leaders, companies, and talent.\par\bullet Promote visibility for technologies, services, and businesses that support the Salesforce ecosystem.\par\bullet Strengthen the local ecosystem through community engagement and networking.\par\bullet Offer sponsors meaningful exposure before, during, and after the event.\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par\b Event Information\b0\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par\bullet Event name: Bogotá Dreamin'\par\bullet Date: 5 or 12 December 2025\par\bullet Venue: WeWork, Calle 116, Bogotá\par\bullet Time: 9:00 AM - 1:00 PM\par\bullet Audience: Salesforce ecosystem professionals, users, partners, developers, consultants, business teams, and community members\par\bullet Expected attendance: 100+ participants\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par\b Sponsor Levels\b0\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par\b Gold Sponsor - $5,000,000 COP\b0\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par\bullet Premium visibility in all event materials and presentations\par\bullet Logo prominently displayed on event branding across digital and on-site materials\par\bullet Sponsor booth in the main event area\par\bullet Recognition during opening and closing remarks\par\bullet 10 VIP passes to the event\par\bullet Inclusion in event social media promotion before and after the event\par\bullet Post-event podcast / short interview (up to 30 minutes) featuring the sponsor, discussing their experience as a sponsor of Colombia's first Salesforce-focused community event, their vision for the ecosystem, and future opportunities\par\bullet Opportunity to contribute branded material or giveaway items at the sponsor booth\par\bullet Highlighted mention in event recap communications\par\bullet Preferential visibility in networking moments\par\bullet Opportunity to participate in special community moments to strengthen brand presence\par\par\b Silver Sponsor - $3,000,000 COP\b0\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par\bullet Visibility in the event presentations and digital materials\par\bullet Sponsor booth in the event area\par\bullet 5 VIP passes to the event\par\bullet Brand mention in social media promotion\par\bullet Inclusion in event recap communication\par\bullet Sponsor material placement at the booth\par\bullet Recognition during the event as a supporting sponsor\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par\b Bronze Sponsor - $1,000,000 COP\b0\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par\bullet Recognition in all event presentations\par\bullet Inclusion in event materials and website listing\par\bullet 2 VIP passes to the event\par\bullet Social media acknowledgment\par\bullet Brand visibility in event recap communication\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par\b Additional Sponsor Benefits and Activation Ideas\b0\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par\bullet Post-event podcast / short interview: A sponsored conversation highlighting the sponsor's experience, their vision for Salesforce in Colombia, and what they expect for the future of the ecosystem.\par\bullet Sponsor-sponsored raffles / giveaways: Sponsors may contribute prizes for dynamic giveaways during selected sessions or networking moments, as agreed with the event team.\par\bullet Branded merchandising at the booth (flyers, brochures, gadgets, promotional materials, etc.)\par\bullet Community exposure in event communication channels\par\par\b Event Benefits for Sponsors\b0\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par Sponsoring Bogotá Dreamin' provides a direct line to a relevant and engaged Salesforce audience in Colombia. Sponsors will have the opportunity to strengthen brand presence, generate new leads, create visibility in the local ecosystem, and participate in a high-quality community event designed to foster learning and collaboration.\par\par We are creating a first-class event experience focused on professional relevance, networking, and brand attention, giving sponsors a platform to connect with professionals from different functional areas and levels of Salesforce experience.\par\par\b Sponsorship Commitment\b0\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par Sponsors will be recognized as strategic partners of Bogotá Dreamin' and will support the creation of a meaningful community experience for attendees, speakers, and local Salesforce professionals.\par\par Sponsorship packages will be finalized based on availability and event planning priorities.\par\par\b Contact Information\b0\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par\bullet Email: yeistic@gmail.com\par\bullet Coordinators: Nicolas Vasquez, Felipe Florian, Julian Poveda, Andres Ramirez, Yeison Naranjo\par\bullet LinkedIn Group: https://www.linkedin.com/groups/10032077/\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par\b Closing\b0\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par We invite companies, partners, and brands connected to Salesforce to join us in shaping the first Bogotá Dreamin' as a relevant, valuable, and memorable community event in Colombia.\par\par Your support will help create an impactful experience for attendees while also giving your organization visible, strategic exposure within the Salesforce ecosystem.\par\par We would be pleased to meet with you to discuss the sponsorship opportunity in more detail and tailor a customized package according to your objectives.\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par\b Thank you for your time and consideration.\b0\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par\par\b Bogotá Dreamin' Team\b0\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs20\par}